f mutations), which is where a race would differ</p><p><b>Where it ran: </b>dev unit U11; test method AGENT · Browser agent; lane planned in the matrix: browser agent (automated)</p><p><small>S20 is our own case number (its number in the coverage matrix cases/TC-06.matrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>25acd72</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-15T14:04:39Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> AGENT · Browser agent — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-06/S20</p><p><b>Quick repeated changes: the last choice wins everywhere (both contexts)</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92584 Admission Status Toggle (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>generated/tc06s20/verdict.json</code>). Agent: 43 turns, 241 s, $0.23.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U11 (#11, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Quick repeated badge changes. Legacy seed; badge unit above is at 122 turns, adding it would pass 150.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #11, U11; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — four quick badge changes end on New Admission, survive reload; NH same; template follows (H&amp;P)</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-06 Admission Status Toggle","S20 Quick repeated changes: the last choice wins everywhere (both contexts)"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"9633cfef148e23489c8e8d828119efe2","originalFileName":"b3ba8632-5d50-4152-939b-3ad6bab965d8-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed